        {
          "id": "782f6c10-48e3-409d-8c3d-4c79830b62f8",
          "memory": "Maya is on day three of dairy-free oat milk as of October 13, 2026, saying her stomach is still calm with no regrets, resisted a grilled cheese craving on the night of October 12 and ate plain tomato soup instead, drinks oat lattes in coffee so far and plans to try oat milk in cereal on October 14 after User said it is creamy.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "92a554e5-1d60-4409-b80e-6fc26f9b6c48",
          "memory": "Maya's sister is focused on her birthday pizza gathering at 4pm on Saturday, October 17, 2026 with just her friends, has not signed up for pottery, with Maya planning to tell her to arrive early and both hoping patio weather holds.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "8b73b211-09e2-49d5-aabb-132340be2663",
          "memory": "User and Maya agreed on October 13, 2026 to move their Friday lunch to noon, an hour earlier, because Maya has a 2pm call she does not want to rush, keeping the same hour-ish plan with User slipping out from the office, arriving first to grab a table for chair safety check duty.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "18f850c7-f77d-4e67-83b1-f417646b0287",
          "memory": "User, Maya and Leo planned a single joint lunch at Rosa's on Oak Street at noon on Friday, October 23, 2026, moved from DMs to the Friday crew group to avoid two pizza plans, confirmed as next week not October 16, with Leo joining despite never having been to Rosa's.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "1c18a4e3-6654-4a74-bbcf-c099d1457804",
          "memory": "User, Maya and Leo recalled past pizza outings where Mario's salty olive slice was a brutal salt bomb that scarred Leo, while Luigi's last week was much better with elite parmesan knots and a legit cheese pull, leaving Rosa's with big shoes to fill.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d865c9e7-613e-4c43-b077-f431773488a2",
          "memory": "For Rosa's on Oak Street, User will walk about 10 minutes from the office and meet out front like at Luigi's, Maya will bus over after morning gym hoping it is weirdly fast as last time, and Leo will drive and text when close, with Oak Street parking noted as much easier than Pine Street and circling 15 minutes at Mario's.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "cfe31c4c-bddd-4a22-8c22-744834364160",
          "memory": "On October 13, 2026 Leo's kitchen sink was empty in the morning with a four-day clean record to beat before likely getting messy by night, while Maya's laundry is exploding, User's laundry is still sitting in the dryer, and Leo joked his laundry escaped the basket then jumped back in.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4bda486-eaa3-40d5-87a7-cc2092a4f806",
          "memory": "Maya did legs at morning gym on Monday, October 12, 2026 leaving her legs dead, planned arms on Tuesday, October 13, 2026, and caught herself thinking the 'never go back to workkkk' crying suit guy line at the gym on October 12.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "3761b89f-a00d-4f6e-82e4-93dd5a930cbc",
          "memory": "User, Maya and Leo joked about the 'never go back to workkkk' crying suit guy line being iconic and stuck in their brains, and tentatively planned one quick round of the cooking game on the night of October 13 with a two-fires-max house rule that Maya adopted.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "3227a42a-6ae3-4eda-a39c-07909a14c1ae",
          "memory": "On October 13, 2026 all three reported laptop trouble with Maya still ghosted by IT after freezing twice on October 12, User's laptop dragging and laggy since sitting down at the desk, and Leo restarting twice, calling it a classic toolkit fail amid morning meetings.",
          "event": "ADD"
