        {
          "id": "78b5f9ef-c28f-4fe7-8ccd-2421c5dddb7b",
          "memory": "Offices were freezing on October 13, 2026 with User wearing a heavy jacket inside and saying inside feels colder than outside, Maya drinking tea, User planning chamomile to warm up and Leo wanting the weird lemon tea virtually, which Maya remembered as their order with fall jacket uniform now permanent.",
