        {
          "id": "2ff7be62-525d-4b30-9847-5764268f572c",
          "memory": "On the morning of October 13, 2026 User checked houseplants before leaving and found them less droopy, continuing the redemption arc, learned Maya's miracle basil is still alive and thriving on the sunny windowsill, and is considering moving own plants from the dark kitchen to a windowsill.",
